{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09467","headline":"燕衔泥 · 韦应物","name":"燕衔泥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衔泥燕，声喽喽。\n尾涎涎，秋去何所归。\n春来复相见，岂不解决绝高飞碧云里。\n何爲地上衔泥滓，衔泥虽贱意有营。\n杏梁朝日巢欲成，不见百鸟畏人林野宿。\n翻遭网罗俎其肉，未若衔泥入华屋。\n燕衔泥，百鸟之智莫与齐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09467.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09467","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}